---

<BaseLayout
  title="Certified Clothing Manufacturer | 13 Certifications | SDF"
  description="SDF Clothing holds 13 international certifications — GOTS, OEKO-TEX, ISO 9001, BSCI, SEDEX, WRAP, GRS, SA8000 and more. Compliant for EU, UK, and USA markets."

  ogImage="https://sdfltd.com/factory.jpg"
  ogImageType="image/webp"
  schema={schema}
>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="padding: 1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);">
    <div class="container">
      <ol style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;list-style:none;font-size:0.75rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">
        <li><a href="/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);text-decoration:none;transition:color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#e00'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(255,255,255,0.5)'">Home</a></li>
        <li style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);">/</li>
        <li style="color:#fff;">Certifications</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main id="main-content">

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section style="padding: 5rem 0 3.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header" style="max-width:800px;">
          <span class="section-label">Excellence</span>
          <div class="accent-line"></div>
          <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:300;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
            Certified Clothing Manufacturer With 13 International Certifications
          </h1>
          <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.8;max-width:700px;">
            We provide compliant apparel production with verified standards. Our GOTS certified factory and OEKO-TEX certified manufacturer status ensure chemical-free clothing production for EU, UK, USA markets. We are an ethical clothing manufacturer with social compliance certification and sustainable certified factory operations.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why Certification Matters -->
    <section style="padding: 4rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header" style="max-width:800px;">
          <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.5vw,2rem);font-weight:400;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
            Why Certification Matters for Global Clothing Buyers
          </h2>
          <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.8;">
            When sourcing from a certified manufacturer, you gain verified assurance of quality, ethics, and compliance. Our ISO certified garment factory meets international standards, protecting your brand from supply chain risks and ensuring market access across EU, UK, and USA regulations.
          </p>
